2	//!
3	//! This platform is used for visual tests that need:
4	//! - Real rendering (e.g. Metal/compositor) for accurate screenshots
5	//! - Deterministic task scheduling via TestDispatcher
6	//! - Controllable time via `advance_clock`
7	
